<ToolLayout title="About" description="About this website and why its tools run entirely in your browser.">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>This website offers free online tools for everyday file and data tasks, such as renaming files, merging PDFs, and converting or comparing CSV files.</p>
  <p>Every tool runs entirely in your browser. Your files are never uploaded, so your documents and data stay private on your own device.</p>
  <p>We add new tools regularly. If you have a suggestion, please <a href="/contact">get in touch</a>.</p>
</ToolLayout>